cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Cushion, please cite it as below."
title: "Cushion: soft-robotics simulation in Grasshopper, powered by SOFA"
abstract: >-
  A Grasshopper plugin that connects parametric modeling in Rhino and
  Grasshopper to SOFA's soft-body finite-element solver. Deformable bodies,
  pneumatic cavities, tendons, stiffened regions, and actuation schedules are
  defined as components; Cushion meshes the geometry, runs the SOFA simulation,
  and returns trajectories, forces, contacts, and deformed shapes to Grasshopper.
type: software
